    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo coming soon! Meet us on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/26696208315a3633a19eccccaf432dbb.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/26696208315a3633a19eccccaf432dbb.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/26696208315a3633a19eccccaf432dbb.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're planning to release a demo for IndusTree soon! Join our Discord to get notified when it happens! (link in the sidebar here on Steam)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>IndusTree is our cozy tree building game where you get random tiles and try to place them as best as you can to grow your very own special tree. Meanwhile nature throws various challenges at you like bad weather, pests, climate, diseases, etc. <br><br>Try to survive as best as you can by completing objectives, earning new tiles and opening booster packs that may specialize your stack of tiles in a certain direction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/dedb6b972c9bd18fc97f1266f120790f.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Seperate cards with tree parts let you design your tree just the way you like it! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/ba38ae733be3b6916bcfa40e58de2760.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Positive and negative events mix up the flow and either help or hinder your growth! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/9f538f568888fa2f2b8d1aafd659b511.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Booster packs include different kinds of tiles, so choose wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Weather that influences you and your environment!<br></li><li>Seasons with fitting atmosphere and challenges!<br></li><li>Events that mix up gameplay!<br></li><li>Challenges that add a sense of progression and fitting rewards!<br></li><li>Relaxing atmosphere and music!<br></li><li>Cozy gameplay!<br></li><li>Underground exploration!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "IndusTree is our cozy tree building game where you get random tiles and try to place them as best as you can to grow your very own special tree. Meanwhile nature throws various challenges at you like bad weather, pests, climate, diseases, etc. <br><br>Try to survive as best as you can by completing objectives, earning new tiles and opening booster packs that may specialize your stack of tiles in a certain direction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/dedb6b972c9bd18fc97f1266f120790f.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/e83c98164480c7a09337cd31afa70984.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Seperate cards with tree parts let you design your tree just the way you like it! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/ba38ae733be3b6916bcfa40e58de2760.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/7954bb31824048bcf44c710162640572.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Positive and negative events mix up the flow and either help or hinder your growth! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/9f538f568888fa2f2b8d1aafd659b511.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.poster.avif?t=1731776484\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.webm?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2758740/extras/f2ef4ae87e36eff66b861e67268081d8.mp4?t=1731776484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Booster packs include different kinds of tiles, so choose wisely.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Weather that influences you and your environment!<br></li><li>Seasons with fitting atmosphere and challenges!<br></li><li>Events that mix up gameplay!<br></li><li>Challenges that add a sense of progression and fitting rewards!<br></li><li>Relaxing atmosphere and music!<br></li><li>Cozy gameplay!<br></li><li>Underground exploration!</li></ul>",
